a-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-uqiiksh5eflo\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 268.992px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Metro</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 218.976px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1 km away</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"2\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 186.048px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Frequent</span><br class=\"zw-br\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table><div><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000771001\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b><br>Future Development:</b></span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">An elevated metro on the North-South corridor of the <b>Blue Line of Namma Metro</b> is likely to start operations by 2026. Bangalore Bellandur shall be connected to Bangalore's other important areas.</span></p><p></p><p><b>Essential Services available<br></b>Most importantly, access to the most basic service provision areas, including grocery stores, pharmacies, and hospitals, should be taken into consideration. Distances to basic stores and facilities can greatly make one's daily life easy.</p></div><p></p><p></p>",
