      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">4.Financial Aspects</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc2sgkvbw71d9t\",\"id\":\"toc_w372nk6jjvrt\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_w372nk6jjvrt\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc2sgkvbw71d9t\",\"id\":\"toc_w372nk6jjvrt\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_w372nk6jjvrt\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">What's important to know is the financial aspect of renting a studio apartment.<br></span><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Average Rental Prices in Bellandur</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toczu2c3v0r8bb9\",\"id\":\"toc_wm0nh6oww0d9\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_wm0nh6oww0d9\">&nbsp;</span></b><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toczu2c3v0r8bb9\",\"id\":\"toc_wm0nh6oww0d9\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_wm0nh6oww0d9\"><b>&nbsp;<br></b></span>Rental prices vary based on location and amenities offered.<br></p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-right\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-left\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"2.698in\"},{\"wt\":\"4.323in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.02in\" data-table-name=\"Table_5\" class=\"zw-table\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-j57wqy3c88lc\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 259.008px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</b> Apartment Type</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 415.008px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Average Rent (per month)</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-1idabajii1tq\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 259.008px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Studio</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 415.008px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;₹10,000 - ₹25,000</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><b style=\"\">Additional Costs</b><b><br></b><p>Apart from rent, consider other costs like<br>1.Maintenance fees,<br>2.utilities (water, electricity), and internet charges.<br>3. Brokerage fee.</p><p><b>Lease Agreement Insights<br></b>A lease agreement is a legal document you must pay attention to, and in it, your rights and responsibilities as a tenant are highlighted.</p><p><b>Key Clauses to Look For<br></b>Look for clauses in the lease<br><b>Duration of Lease: </b>Know how long you are agreeing to stay on<br><b>Termination Clause:</b> Know if you can leave before time.<br><b>Rent Increase Policy:</b> Determine how often the rent can be raised during your tenancy.<br><b><br>Importance of Reading the Fine Print</b><br>Read the whole tenancy agreement word to word before signing it. In case you are not sure about certain clause or features of the tenancy, ask the landlord questions for clarification.</p>",
      "type": "text-block"
